0293482858", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830822_1517280296816191_3248062158835930793_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZgxHy64Gg8kQ7kNvwFnClXm&_nc_oc=Adp0Fiu7Qu9Ulj_2KveLhTT7_keSTem4zzgt2rT2frZWk3BJnl7W0O-jsp2W3_RfK0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFRo0-i5fmwJAxyMKdhcudgjlP_0N29AqFSdyPe4ayMmg&oe=6A8ECA0D"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 4.png", "id": "2180576715838619", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620985_2180576719171952_4179132521064836612_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZlUGF39oE6YQ7kNvwF3e_In&_nc_oc=Adq4MfTiADNgny14U1Wc2FmLljUA3TXKEwxoJzFPBdME0V64UGvkLR1RyUKGPdbzJTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHxAJySFHZp6FeLp6yEnVBB42zc_lHBTUhPqCY3yx_xWQ&oe=6A8ED2E6"}, {"file_name": "hvac pers 5.png", "id": "1342847194692771", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622162_1342847198026104_6158502527951782000_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MxgPYmhD_d4Q7kNvwFRVd04&_nc_oc=Adp6s-itlOhBqu3NfJWfadCyG01zZIiComCrrfEYquuIo60HMR_NEAyWc2oSdMea-kk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEDz04210DK15A4Prugw8hq8nweZLNWrmEZ9iwBUSrEIw&oe=6A8EE3D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "hvac personal thumbnail.png", "id": "1365445488881358", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1365445492214691_7647014581930130160_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TXHcAGF-5VIQ7kNvwGAvL1H&_nc_oc=Adrsc3kMu8AuaOO6MgdnBXHOVdA518KPI1nXEGsRC9vUXCy6w73E-Sqkc5Idm2DSiEM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHHpvK8c0rChDMFsU2RvmE_TV0HXHfSA3LSe-iOcgFXAw&oe=6A8ED1F4"}, "display_name": "Skillveri HVAC Simulator-Personal Use", "keywords": ["skillveri", "hvac", "simulator", "cte", "vr"], "long_description": "The simulation technology that powers workforce training in the world\u2019s leading industries, now in a personal use version for individuals!\nStep into a fully immersive HVAC training environment with Skillveri HVAC Simulator - Personal Use edition.\n\nForget watching videos - start doing. Using Skillveri\u2019s advanced hand-tracking technology, you can perform all actions naturally with your hands, just as you would in the field - no controllers needed!\n\nThe realistic VR simulation for aspiring HVAC techs, this Personal version offers you hands-on practice anytime, anywhere.\n\nImmerse yourself in a realistic scenario and navigate complex tasks with ease using visual cues and step by step instructions.\n\nThis Personal version contains:\n- Commercial HVAC Cleaning and Maintenance\n- Residential HVAC Leak Testing\n\nReady to scale your training or adopt it for your institution? For our fully-loaded Enterprise version, perfect for schools and training institutions, contact us at usa@skillveri.com. Skillveri simulators are used across 100+ schools and colleges across the USA in their CTE programs.", "short_description": "Master HVAC skills in immersive VR - no risk, no tools, no wastage. Perform all actions with your hands exactly as in real life - no VR controllers needed! Perfect for building real-world confidence before stepping onto a job site.\n\nIn this Personal Use edition, learn Commercial HVAC cleaning & Residential HVAC leak testing inside realistic 3D environments. Hands-on practice - anytime, anywhere, at your own pace.\n\nWrite to usa@skillveri.com for the Enterprise version for schools or institutions."}]}, "developer_name": "Skillveri Inc", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skillveri.com/kelvin-lite-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skillveri Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.skillveri.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "